- ### Prefix dictionaries
+ ### Diccionarios de prefijos

- Where lookup is by exact key, a `Dictionary` maps text to values through a
- [trie](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trie). A lookup costs the length of the key, not a hash of
- the whole of it, and a query by prefix costs the length of the prefix:
+ Cuando la búsqueda es por clave exacta, un `Dictionary` asocia texto con valores mediante un
+ [trie](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trie). Una búsqueda cuesta la longitud de la clave, no un
+ hash de toda ella, y una consulta por prefijo cuesta la longitud del prefijo:

= the whole of it, and a query by prefix costs the length of the prefix:
=
- ```scala
+ ```scala

- val dictionary = Dictionary(t"color" -> 0, t"colour" -> 1)
+ val dictionary = Dictionary(t"color" -> 0, t"colour" -> 1)

= val dictionary = Dictionary(t"color" -> 0, t"colour" -> 1)
- ```
+ ```

= val dictionary = Dictionary(t"color" -> 0, t"colour" -> 1)
= ```
=
- ```scala fuel
+ ```scala fuel

= val dictionary = Dictionary(t"color" -> 0, t"colour" -> 1)
= ```
=
= ```scala fuel
- run
+ run

= val dictionary = Dictionary(t"color" -> 0, t"colour" -> 1)
= ```
